    "detailed_description": "This is a strategy type of role-playing game. Players will help a princess escape the maze where she is imprisoned. But this is no ordinary maze. At first you might think it has no outlet. But through princess magic you can change the space. The original walls and ceilings may become passageways after changing the space. There is a limit to the number of spells a princess can cast. Players need to think carefully before taking action. Finally help the princess to regain her freedom!<br />\r\n\u00b7 The princess is trapped in a maze with bound hands, and the player needs to control the princess to escape from one room to another in the maze.<br />\r\n\u00b7 The maze appears to have no path, but the princess can cast a spell to rotate the orientation of the maze to create a new path.<br />\r\n\u00b7 3D view<br />\r\n\u00b7 Exquisite character modeling<br />\r\n\u00b7 Imaginative level design<br />\r\n\u00b7 Innovative maze and space switching gameplay",
